{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with the stronger imagenet_vit_l image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy (0.706) and F1 (0.667) exceed the RNA-only baseline (0.650 accuracy, 0.628 F1), suggesting multimodal components may improve performance. However, the exact contribution of the image encoder or fusion strategy remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
}

